330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( GROWING UP IN THE QUIET TOWN OF LORETO, ITALY, AGNUS LAMB WAS RAISED IN A TRADITIONAL, RELIGIOUS HOUSEHOLD AND ATTENDED CATHOLIC SCHOOL. LOOKING UP AT THE NIGHT SKY BECAME HER ESCAPE. THE CONSTELLATIONS CONNECTING HER TO PLACES AND PEOPLE FAR BEYOND HER OWN WORLD.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
331 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (AFTER GRADUATING, AGNUS LEFT LORETO TO EXPLORE THE CULTURES SHE ONCE IMAGINED FROM AFAR. HER TRAVELS INTRODUCED HER TO NEW FORMS OF ARTISTRY AND SHOWED HER HOW DEEPLY EXPRESSION SHAPES IDENTITY.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
332 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (RETURNING HOME WITH A FRESH PERSPECTIVE, SHE REALIZED SHE COULD BRING THE CREATIVITY SHE FOUND BACK TO LORETO. INSPIRED BY HER UPBRINGING AND HER EARLY LATIN STUDIES, SHE FOUNDED AGNUS DEI, A BRAND ROOTED IN HERITAGE, SYMBOLISM, AND THE BELIEF THAT JEWELLERY SHOULD CELEBRATE INDIVIDUALITY.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (WHAT BEGAN AS A SMALL BOUTIQUE IN ITALY HAS GROWN INTO A PRESENCE IN SEVERAL FASHION CAPITALS. TODAY, AGNUS DEI CONTINUES HER MISSION TO CREATE JEWELLERY THAT EMPOWERS PEOPLE TO EXPRESS WHO THEY TRULY ARE.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
